title: The lantern supper
from: Chef Auda Brennan
gist: Brennan came to the lantern supper to eat. It wasn't her stew, and she asked for it again.
== lines
brennan: That's not my stew, love.   [listen]
brennan: ... Make it again on Friday.   [nod]
